WEBVTT

00:15:28.165 --> 00:15:30.403
or lost or inattentive.

00:15:30.427 --> 00:15:33.942
So you might need to catch them up.

00:15:33.966 --> 00:15:37.339
But another use
is through remote teaching,

00:15:37.363 --> 00:15:39.985
which is something really amazing.

00:15:40.298 --> 00:15:43.711
What is happening is, in China,

00:15:43.735 --> 00:15:47.402
the education depends
on the quality of the teachers.

00:15:47.426 --> 00:15:49.863
And in the cities,
there are great teachers,

00:15:49.887 --> 00:15:52.180
because they are educated
by the top school,

00:15:52.204 --> 00:15:55.768
they may have been
Math Olympiad participants,

00:15:55.792 --> 00:15:57.173
and then in the countryside,

00:15:57.197 --> 00:16:00.347
there are teachers who are not
nearly as good or experienced.